# ANANKE Native Quantum Script
# Testing Deutsch-Jozsa Algorithm to evaluate a function in a single execution step
qubits 2

# Initialize target ancilla qubit 1 to |1> using Pauli-X
gate X 1

# Put both data qubit 0 and ancilla qubit 1 into full superposition
gate H 0
gate H 1

# Fire the hidden black-box function. Try switching 'balanced' to 'constant' to test both paths!
oracle balanced

# Apply Hadamard again to decode interference channels
gate H 0

# If data qubit 0 measures |0>, the function is CONSTANT. If it measures |1>, it is BALANCED.
measure
